             timer.  The _n_u_m_b_e_r must be 1, 2, or 3 and it means route flags of
             RTF_PROTO1, RTF_PROTO2, or RTF_PROTO3.  When 1 is specified,
             routes with RTF_PROTO1 will never expire.

