     --qq      Makes rroouuttee66dd in listen-only mode.  No advertisement is sent.

     --ss      Makes rroouuttee66dd to advertise the statically defined routes which
             exist in the kernel routing table when rroouuttee66dd invoked.  An‐
             nouncements obey the regular split horizon rule.

     --SS      This option is the same as --ss option except that no split horizon
